id: pm-rl-tqym
title: pm CLI 2026.8.6 exposes untested fallback-author branches under the exact coverage gate
description: "Updating the package lock from pm CLI 2026.8.1 to 2026.8.6 makes the testing harness inject context.sdk. The real fallback remains required for direct and legacy host contexts, but the previous harness-based assertion no longer executes its author normalization branches; the full release gate falls from 100% to 99.07% branch coverage. Add direct behavioral cases for missing, blank, and explicit authors and update the now-stale harness documentation."
