completed_at: "2026-08-06T22:57:04.168Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Direct command execution with missing, blank, and explicit authors succeeds against a real tracker; the injected SDK path remains covered; npm run release:check passes exact 100/100/100; no ignore directives or source exclusions are introduced"
severity: medium
environment: "Node 26.5.0, pm CLI 2026.8.6"
repro_steps: "Resolve @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.6, run npm run release:check, and inspect coverage/lcov.info lines 104-105."
expected_result: The exact 100/100/100 gate remains green while behaviorally exercising every supported client resolution path.
actual_result: "The release gate reports index.ts at 98.10% branch coverage and 99.07% overall, with uncovered branches on author normalization."
affected_version: 2026.7.31
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T22:57:03.754Z",codex,"Reproduced before the test change on pm CLI 2026.8.6: 99.07% overall branches, with both uncovered branches mapped by LCOV to the fallback author normalization. Added real direct-command executions with absent, blank, and explicit authors; coverage now reports index.ts and series.ts at exact 100/100/100 without ignores or exclusions."
